Package: llmbiobench
Title: Setup benchmark testing for LLMs
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("BiocCoding", "Collaborations", , "bioccoding@bioconductor.org", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Create folders and json files for benchmarking accuracy of LLMs. The
  package is designed to be used in conjunction with providers such as ChatGPT,
  Gemini, Claude, etc. The package makes use of the 'ellmer' package to
  facilitate the benchmarking process. 
License: Artistic-2.0
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Imports: 
    jsonlite
Suggests:
    ellmer,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.0
Config/testthat/edition: 3
